  m_Name: Evento_CongestionamentoRecorde
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Congestionamento Recorde
  _titleEn: Record Traffic Jam
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: Quando muita gente depende do carro, um acidente ou uma chuva bastam
    para travar a cidade inteira.
  _summaryEn: When many people depend on cars, one accident or a rainstorm is enough
    to gridlock the whole city.
  _realWorld: "S\xE3o Paulo criou em 1997 o rod\xEDzio municipal de ve\xEDculos,
    que pro\xEDbe parte da frota de circular no centro expandido nos hor\xE1rios
    de pico conforme o final da placa."
  _realWorldEn: "In 1997 S\xE3o Paulo created its vehicle rotation scheme, which
    bans part of the fleet from the expanded center at peak hours according to the
    license plate's last digit."
  _tradeOffs: "Medidas que s\xF3 limitam o carro aliviam por pouco tempo; sem transporte
    coletivo bom, o tr\xE2nsito volta."
  _tradeOffsEn: Measures that only restrict cars help for a short time; without good
    public transport, traffic comes back.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Rod\xEDzio de ve\xEDculos de S\xE3o Paulo (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rod%C3%ADzio_de_ve%C3%ADculos_de_S%C3%A3o_Paulo
